<title>NORWAY: Saga delays Tordis East oilfield start.</title>
<headline>Saga delays Tordis East oilfield start.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saga Petroleum ASA said on Thursday it had postponed the start up of the North Sea Tordis East oilfield to the fourth quarter of the year due to reduced availability of drilling rigs.</p>
<p>Tordis East originally was due to come on stream at the end of August.</p>
<p>Saga said the Varg development, which was scheduled to come on stream in the first half of 1998, also was &quot;some weeks&quot; behind schedule due to delays with the construction of the hull and the planning and purchase of processing equipment.</p>
<p>-- Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
